        "sid": "NUM 32"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "32",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abena Rubeni na bena Gadi, abakwete iŋombe ne mpaanga ishingi, bamwene ifyalo fya ku Yaseri na Gileadi ukuti fisuma nganshi ukutekelamo ifitekwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo baya kuli Mose na Eleasa shimapepo ne ntungulushi sha lukuta, babeba abati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ataroti, Diboni, Yaseri, Nimura, Heshiboni, Eleale, Sebamu, Nebo na Beoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "icalo ico Yawe apokolwele pa cinso ca lukuta lwa bena Israeli nacilinga ukutekelamo ifitekwa, na babomfi benu nabakwata ifitekwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batile, “Nga cakuti mwatulangulukilako, lekeni cino calo cipeelwe ku babomfi benu pakuti cibe icuma cesu. Mwituleka twabuke Yordani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose atile ku bena Gadi na bena Rubeni, “Bushe mulefwaya ukushala no kwikala kuno ilyo abanenu baleya ku nkondo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bushe cinshi ico muletompwela imitima ya bena Israeli pakuti beya mu calo Yawe abapeela? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.13.17+NUM.13.18+NUM.13.19+NUM.13.20+NUM.13.21+NUM.13.22+NUM.13.23+NUM.13.24+NUM.13.25+NUM.13.26+NUM.13.27+NUM.13.28+NUM.13.29+NUM.13.30+NUM.13.31+NUM.13.32+NUM.13.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Imp 13:17-33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifi fine efyo na bashinwe bacitile, ilyo nabatumine ukufuma ku Kadeshi Banea kukuya lengula icalo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Panuma yakuya fika kwishika lya Eshikoli no kumona icalo, babwelele no kutompola imitima ya bena Israeli mukukanaingila mu calo Yawe abapeele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.14.26+NUM.14.27+NUM.14.28+NUM.14.29+NUM.14.30+NUM.14.31+NUM.14.32+NUM.14.33+NUM.14.34+NUM.14.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Imp 14:26-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawe alifulilwe nganshi, ubo bushiku alapa noyu mulapo ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Pantu aba bantu tabankonkele ne mitima yabo yonse, tapali nangu umo umwaume uuli ne myaka amakumi yabili (20) nangu ukucilapo, uwafumine mu Egupto, uukamona icalo nalaile mukulapa ukupeela Abrahamu, Isaki na Yakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tapali nangu umo kanofye Kalebu mwana Yefune umwina Kenasi na Yoshua mwana Nuni, pantu bena balikonkele Yawe ne mitima yabo yonse.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawe afulilwe abena Israeli, abalenga no kululumba mu matololo pa myaka amakumi yane, mpakafye inkulo ya balya bonse abacitile ifyabipa pa cinso cakwe yasuka yapwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili moneni, mwe luko lubifi, mwaibika pa fifulo fya bashinwe, no kulenga Yawe alundepo ukufulilwa Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga cakuti mwataluka ukumfwila Yawe, nakabili line akabalekako aba bantu bonse mu matolo, kabili nimwe mukalenga ukuti bonaike.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo bapalamine kuli ena abati, “Tulefwaya tukuule amacinka ya fitekwa fyesu, ne misumba ya banakashi besu na bana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo tuli abaipekanya mukuipangasha fwe bene no kuba pantanshi ya bena Israeli, mpakafye tukabafishe mu cifulo cabo. Lelo pali ino nshita abanakashi besu na bana nababale bekale mu misumba ya malinga, pakubacingililako ku bekashi ba calo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tatwakabwelele ku mayanda yesu, mpakafye umwina Israeli onse akapokelele ica cishilano cakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifwe tatwakapokeko icacishilano pamo nabo mwishilya lya mumana wa Yordani, pantu ifwe ica cishilano cesu caba kuno bushilya ku kabanga ka Yordani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Mose atile kuli bena, “Kuti mwabwelelamofye nga cakuti mwacita ici. Mwaipangasha mwe bene pa cinso cakwa Yawe ukuya ku bulwi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kabili nga abaipangasha bonse mwaya abuka Yordani pa cinso cakwa Yawe, mpaka akafulumunemo abalwani bakwe ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no kucimfya cilya calo pa cinso cakwe, lyena kuti mwabwelelamo no kuba abakaele kuli Yawe na ku bena Israeli. Kabili ici calo cikaba cuma cenu pa cinso cakwa Yawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo nga mwafilwa ukucita ico mwalaya, ninshi mwabifya kuli Yawe. Elyo muli nokushininkisha ukuti ububifi bwenu buli nokuba pali imwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuuleni imisumba ya banakashi benu na bana, na macinka ya fitekwa, lelo mucite ico mulaile!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abena Gadi na bena Rubeni batile kuli Mose, “Ifwe fwe babomfi bobe tuli nokucita ifyo wakonkomesha we mfumu yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abana besu na bakashi, imikuni yesu ya mpaanga ne imbushi ne ŋombe, fikashala mu misumba ya Gileadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo ababomfi benu, umwaume onsefye uipangeshe ku bulwi, ali no kwabuka mukulwisha pa cinso cakwa Yawe, pamo ngefyo wasosa we mfumu yesu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
