            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.1.12+JOS.1.13+JOS.1.14+JOS.1.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yosh 1:12-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Mose apeele ifipope pali bena kuli Eleasa shimapepo na Yoshua mwana Nuni ne ntungulushi sha ndupwa sha nko sha bena Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atile kuli bena, “Nga cakuti abena Gadi na bena Rubeni, umwaume onsefye uuipangeshe ku bulwi, ayabuka Yordani na imwe pa cinso cakwa Yawe, lyena ilyo mwapoka icalo, nemwe muli nokubapeela icalo ca Gileadi nge cuma cabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo nga tababwike mumana nabaipangasha na imwe pamo, bafwilefye ukukwatako icitungu mu calo ca Kenani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abena Gadi na bena Rubeni bayaswike abati, “Ababomfi benu bali nokucita ifyo Yawe alandile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tuli nokwabuka umumana ukuya mu calo ca Kenani pa cinso cakwa Yawe natuipangasha, lelo icuma ca cishilano cesu cikaba nici kuno kwishilya lya Yordani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Mose apeele ku bena Gadi, abena Rubeni na citika wa luko lwakwa Manase mwana Yosefu icalo cakwa Sihoni imfumu ya bena Amoli, ne calo cakwa Ogi imfumu ya bena Bashani. Icalo conse kumo kwine ne misumba yabamo, ne citungu ca mpanga yonse iyabashingulwike. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abena Gadi bakuulile Diboni, Ataroti, Aroeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atiroti Shofani, Yaseri, Yogebea, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beti Nimura na Beti Harani, nge misumba yakuulililwako amalinga no kukuula amacinka ya fitekwa fyabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abena Rubeni nakabili bakuula Heshiboni, Eleale na Kiriataimu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pamo pene na Nebo, Baali Meoni (aya mashina baliyalwile) na Sibuma. Imisumba imbi bakuulile baliinike amashina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba mu lupwa lwakwa Makiri mwana Manase baile ku Gileadi, bapoka icalo no kufulumunamo abena Amoli abaleikalamo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Mose apeela Gileadi ku bena Makiri, aba mu lupwa lwakwa Manase, kabili eko balaikala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yairi uwa mu lupwa lwakwa Manase apokolola imishi yabo no kulaita ati Hafoti Yairi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32:41",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Hafoti Yairi:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Emukutila Imishi yakwa Yairi.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili Noba nao apokolola Kenati ne mishi yali mumbali, no kulaita ati Noba, pamo nga fintu balemwita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
